# The sound of a new game, for dosrun -r to record: the menu, the
# introduction read aloud, the movie, the first scene's music and effects.
# Areas are of the 1280x960 screen dosrun's DOSBox draws in.

wait menu 814x76+234+470 150
sleep 2
key Return
wait name 400x56+440+152 60
key a b c Return
# the introduction's text: the corner it leaves to the planet
wait text 400x200+700+620 60
sleep 18
key Escape
sleep 15
key Escape
wait scene 280x200+300+124 240
sleep 10
